2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993159Z   ok   all-negative prices: the cheapest (most negative) step starts highest
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993284Z   ok   and the guess is monotone in price rank, inside the same 0.2-1.0 band
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993387Z   ok   the un-guarded formula really did invert on this input
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993581Z   ok   a near-zero mean takes the rank path instead of saturating the clip
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993708Z   ok   sun entirely past the solve horizon moves no warm-start weight (#933)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993828Z   ok   the same sun inside the horizon does discount (#933 null control)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993933Z   ok   a zero-step lookahead leaves every weight at one (#933)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1993937Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1994046Z -- v4.0.4 — grid-fee magnitude repair issue
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1994217Z   ok   max_abs_component finds the öre-as-SEK rule and names its source
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1994369Z   ok   an inactive layer has nothing to warn about
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1994484Z   ok   entity mode inspects the live value, rules mode ignores it
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1994641Z   ok   a 25 SEK/kWh rule — öre in a SEK field — raises the repair issue
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1994770Z   ok   warn-only: the plan still prices with exactly what was typed
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1994888Z   ok   the issue is raised once per offending value, not every cycle
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995016Z   ok   a corrected configuration clears the issue on the next cycle
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995157Z   ok   0.25 SEK/kWh — the value that was meant — raises nothing
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995317Z   ok   a fee sensor publishing öre trips the same issue, attributed to it
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995457Z   ok   a stored negative rule raises the sign notice, attributed to the rules
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995590Z   ok   warn-only: the plan still prices with the negative value it was given
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995722Z   ok   the sign notice is raised once per offending value, not every cycle
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995867Z   ok   and a negative rate of ordinary size is not mistaken for a magnitude slip
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1995978Z   ok   correcting the sign clears the notice on the next cycle
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1996136Z   ok   a fee sensor publishing a negative value trips the same notice, attributed to it
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1996284Z   ok   the magnitude notice and the sign notice are independent: -25 raises both
2026-10-09T01:05:32.1996363Z   ok   0.25 SEK/kWh raises neither
