2026-10-09T01:05:32.2144960Z   ok   the summary says which estimator a bucket rests on, and how many defrosts were actually witnessed
2026-10-09T01:05:32.2145072Z   ok   a duty outside [0, 1] is refused, not folded into the bucket
2026-10-09T01:05:32.2145223Z   ok   the range guard rejects only OUTSIDE [0, 1] — 0 and 1 still fold
