2026-10-09T01:05:32.3016955Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017030Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017118Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017313Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017386Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017442Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017501Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017571Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017639Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017706Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017777Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017847Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
