2026-10-09T01:05:32.3017995Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018070Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018146Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018215Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018301Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018365Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018446Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018518Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018601Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018699Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018797Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018804Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018868Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3018961Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019040Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019113Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019186Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019191Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019266Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019361Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019441Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019510Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019584Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019666Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019782Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019870Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019948Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3019952Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020056Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020183Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020286Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020419Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020423Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020562Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020699Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020814Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3020966Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021086Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021182Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021189Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021310Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021438Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021532Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021617Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021700Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021766Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021869Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3021954Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022023Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022092Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022206Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022288Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022359Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022440Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022613Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022693Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022768Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3022877Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023011Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023120Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023230Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023348Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023442Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023557Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023675Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023783Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3023880Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024010Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024140Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024279Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024365Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024486Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024621Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024729Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024852Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3024991Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025116Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025233Z   ok   the monthly peak sensor publishes the tariff fields it was given
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025364Z   ok   the default silent fraction is the unset value the fold compares against
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025370Z 
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025471Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025587Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025667Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025771Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025863Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3025956Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
