2026-10-09T01:05:32.3026169Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3026248Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-10-09T01:05:32.3026348Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
